# LLM Wiki (mandatory)

Read skill: `~/.cursor/skills/llm-wiki/SKILL.md`

Wiki: `docs/wiki/` at the repo root.

## Before ANY code, config, or behavior change

1. Read `docs/wiki/index.md` and task-relevant pages (features, architecture, session-log).
2. Read `plan.md` and `memory.md` — respect **done vs not done**; do not contradict recorded decisions.
3. Bootstrap `docs/wiki/index.md` + `log.md` if missing on an ongoing project.

## After work — update automatically (no need to ask)

Update wiki on **major** work: features, fixes, refactors, API/schema/deploy changes, milestones.

Skip for: Q&A-only, typos/format-only, trivial non-behavioral edits.

Checklist: read existing pages → update/create → cross-link → `log.md` → `index.md` if new page → session-log for substantial work → `📝 Wiki update:` in response.

Major changes are incomplete until the wiki reflects what changed and why.
